BODY=On /dashboard/analytics Activity tab: with < 20 completed reviews the P95 stat shows "—" with the needs-20-reviews tooltip and no P95 chart bar; with 20 distinct durations p95 equals the second-highest value (nearest-rank), never the maximum by construction; Average and Completed render in both states. Dashboard inspection, no fixture PR.
